{"id":"u-53b49d76-397d-4c45-9004-14a37523a0e7","src":"community","title":"BSD + SUMO","author":"Vadim","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/4VPVMq-bsd-summo","desc":"This 4-day powerlifting-focused strength program is designed to increase maximal strength in the squat, bench press, and both conventional and sumo deadlifts. Built around a 5x5 progression model, it emphasizes compound movements, progressive overload, and proper recovery to drive consistent strength gains.\n\nIn addition to the main lifts, the program includes targeted accessory work for triceps, shoulders, back, legs, and biceps to improve weak points and overall muscular balance. Special grip training is integrated to enhance deadlift performance without relying on straps.\n\nThe structure limits each workout to six exercises to maintain high intensity and focus, while preventing unnecessary fatigue. This program is ideal for intermediate lifters who want to build a stronger total and improve performance in powerlifting-style training.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":120,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:33:23.334Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":9,"x":5}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":9,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Single Arm Iso Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dead H